        <mxCell id="Yctzt4aEiCO2Rvbv2V9s-13" value="Normalmente in MAZZO (main) &lt;br&gt;NON vedi i Nomi delle Carte ma solo :&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Carta_1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Carta_2&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Carta_3&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;Con il Tasto &quot;Osserva&quot; diventano&lt;br&gt;visibili i Nomi Veri&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;(il tasto cambia nome in &quot;Nascondi&quot;&lt;br&gt;e il Tasto &quot;Pesca&quot; diventa &quot;Scegli&quot;)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=#36393d;fillColor=#f9f7ed;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
